  << /ActualText (Enter the four\055digit code on the electronic keypad \050A\051 and confirm by pressing \043\056 Each code is for one\055time use and turns on the power to the sauna for two hours\056 After this time\054 the sauna will turn off automatically\056 The indication that the sauna is working \050turned on\051 is the glowing LEDs inside the sauna\056 Two hours are optimal for heating up the sauna \050which happens quite quickly\051 and completing the entire sauna cycle\056 Next\054 to start the stove and heat up the sauna\054 perform the actions described in section 1\0562\056)
